        <mxCell id="step2-content" value="Identify Threats (STRIDE)&#xa;• S - 身份欺骗&#xa;• T - 数据篡改&#xa;• R - 抵赖行为" style="text;fontSize=14;fontColor=#6B7280;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="1" vertex="1">
